hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1554","Utbah bin Abdullah Al-Yahmadi told us, he said: I read it to Malik. Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us that Malik told him. H and Yahya bin Hakim told us, Bishr bin Omar told us. H Muhammad bin Khallad Al-Bahili told us, on the authority of Maan bin Issa, they said: Malik told us, on the authority of Sumayy, on the authority of Abu Salih, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If people knew what is in the call and the first row, they would have drawn lots for it.”"
"1555","On the authority of Muhammad ibn Harb al-Wasiti, on the authority of Abu Qatn, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Khalas ibn Amr, on the authority of Abu Rafi’, on the authority of Abu Huraira, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If they or you knew what was in the first row, it would have been nothing but a lottery.”"
